   {
    "name": "UR Solar Splash",
    "position": "Chief Engineer · Jan 2016 - Jun 2019",
    "dateRange": {},
    "description": "University of Rochester Solar Splash (URSS) is a multidisciplinary club where members work to design and fabricate a solar/electric boat to compete at the Solar Splash world championship of collegiate solar boating. Responsibilities of Chief of Engineering at URSS include overseeing and supervising the work of both the electrical and mechanical engineering teams. This includes project planning, keeping teams on task, teaching technical skills such as basic CAD modeling and simulation, simple PCB design and fabrication and microcontroller programming to members of varying backgrounds."
